      "requested_change": "Revise claim C1 to state: 'Total net sales for COMPANY_01 increased by 6% (filing reported) from $391,035 million in fiscal year 2024 to $416,161 million in fiscal year 2025 (Item 7, EP_0001_E01). Calculated from raw figures, the increase is approximately 6.43%.'"
